# Feature: Civic Data Platform

Full spec: `doc/spec/civic-data-platform.md`

Companion: `doc/spec/govops-control-plane.md` (enrollment, RBAC, Paperclip OLTP, usage export).

## What it is

Users load files/URLs/Drive/public-request attachments. Parsers emit typed facts with provenance. Authorized users run **read-only SQL** over `published.*` and build dashboard tiles (Dune-like). Not a notebook. Not NL-to-SQL as the only interface. Not raw Paperclip OLTP.

## Data-plane lock

| Plane | Store | Queried by |
|---|---|---|
| Paperclip OLTP | Postgres / D1 | Control-plane APIs only |
| Analytics warehouse | Dedicated Postgres | `POST /api/data/query`, saved dashboards |

`usage_daily` is imported aggregates from GovOps. Never `SUM` civic `money` facts with token cents. Never join `agent_api_keys` or secret material.

## Superparser

- `apps/superparser-service` — ingest/parse **worker**. Keep and evolve.
- `apps/superparser-portal` — **not a site**. Fold into Next `/data/new`.
- Superparser Postgres is a scratchpad, not the Dune `search_path`.
- Production Collaborate is 503 while `SUPERPARSER_URL=""` (`workers/api/wrangler.toml`). That is a launch blocker.

## Warehouse (logical)

Schemas: `ingest`, `warehouse`, `oltp`, `published`. Default SQL search_path is `published`. Facts are typed (`money`, `date`, `ordinance`, `person`, `org`, `place`, `program`) with doc/span/extractor/confidence. PII: `redactPublicText` in `packages/shared/src/public-portal.ts`.

## Query engine

Read-only `SELECT` / `WITH … SELECT`. Timeout, max rows, no DDL/DML, schema allowlist, bind `government_id` for non-platform users. DuckDB-WASM is not the system of record.

APIs: `POST /api/data/query`, `GET/POST /api/data/queries`, `GET /api/data/queries/:id/results`.

## UI (one Next app)

Public: `/data`, `/data/new`, `/data/queries`, `/data/dashboards` (EN/ES in `apps/landing/lib/routes.ts`). Government: `/admin/:prefix/data/*`. `/collaborate` enqueues the same ingest jobs. Embed public dashboards on `/scrutiny`, `/explore`, geo pages.

## Do not in this docs-only pass

Do not create the warehouse, SQL studio, or delete `apps/superparser-portal` until a follow-up implementation PR.
